{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39168","headline":"和集贤侯学士分司丁侍御秋日雨霁之作 · 韦庄","name":"和集贤侯学士分司丁侍御秋日雨霁之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛岸秋晴夕照长，凤楼龙阙倚清光。\n玉泉山净云初散，金谷树多风正凉。\n席上客知蓬岛路，坐中寒有柏台霜。\n多慙十载游梁士，却伴宾鸿入帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}